      en: ["The Aiviekste has a total length of 114 kilometers.", "Its drainage basin covers an area of 9,160 square kilometers.", "The river has a total drop of only 26.9 meters over its entire length.", "The Aiviekste Hydroelectric Plant was once the largest in Latvia.", "More than 30 Stone Age settlements have been documented along the banks.", "Lake Lubāns provides approximately 80% of the water for the Aiviekste."],
